{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:205","content":{"id":205,"title":"21 军工厂和狙击枪","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d777c18c-8ede-43b6-b070-aeb26531fbb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞比 T 细胞稍大，二者都源于骨髓，且都必须进行残酷的训练："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"81b9d25a-0d20-4f26-8e16-9e2b688a53c8","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"82ca07b8-6b00-4bdf-b71b-6adc8f3c4a1e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a60c20a0-75b9-447f-a252-da1df0c68836","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T 细胞在胸腺"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"44a3be44-0d28-4ff7-a61b-54239d389fb3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf519eac-52a2-4645-bc68-8e68869d36ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞在骨髓"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dac6a500-0c0d-4353-a20f-53fabb067d42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞表面至少有几亿到几十亿受体，每个 B 细胞都有 能识别某一特定抗原的特定受体。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8471a34-e73c-46dd-b15c-07631ffd4daa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体是 B 细胞的受体，类似狙击枪，转为结合特定抗原、打击特定敌人打造，精准打击病原体。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d6f61f0-a0be-45e5-86ed-ab5974ec54e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体怎么既是受体，还能是游离武器，抗体在黏附在 B 细胞表面，一旦能结合抗原激活 B 细胞，就会生产并分泌大量新抗体攻击敌人，每秒 2000 个。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"827efbdc-9a76-4cf6-a3c4-1173a2ab1796","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同样 B 细胞经过训练后，游离在淋巴系统，等待被激活"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_818c9ff9-4fb5-4c02-9f13-c3649292f8ce.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"57cd289b-7812-4e9e-9559-d7d223d82054","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1f3eea26-6eda-4fe9-9c15-d94626202379","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞激活不需要树突细胞传递抗原，树突细胞传递的抗源都是短抗原，B 细胞能直接识别大分子抗原。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9775716-c00f-4a9b-bcc0-8cdf999c346a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞不仅能识别到死去的细菌抗原，还能识别补体蛋白的特殊受体，就像是在跟 B 细胞正式确认有危险，B 细胞活化效率提升 100 倍。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe7d6a2b-ea0f-4983-a487-378d6153d5ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在是早期活化阶段，活化的 B 细胞去淋巴结中的一个区域进行自我复制，直到生产两万个，分泌到血液中奔赴战场。这个时候不是最厉害的抗体，如果没有第二次激活，大部分 B 细胞会在一天内凋亡（没有第二次激活就认为症状很轻，为避免不必要损伤，自行毁灭）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0c315ac-95c9-40b5-ab14-9399ab55804e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞和大块抗原结合后，会分解抗原，然后细胞表面的 MHC 分子夹住，这样活化的辅助性 T 细胞的受体才能识别。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"21 军工厂和狙击枪","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:205","type":"doc","id":205}}],"prevPage":{"title":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:204","type":"doc","id":204}},"nextPage":{"title":"22 T 细胞和 B 细胞的共舞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:206","type":"doc","id":206}},"createTime":1741565497207,"updateTime":1743303640525,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640525}}